                                <Border Background="{DynamicResource SurfaceFloating}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource BorderPrimary}" BorderThickness="{DynamicResource PopupBorderThickness}" CornerRadius="{DynamicResource PopupRadius}" Margin="0,5,0,0"
